<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on U.S dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on U.S dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutsche) has issued one million Eurpean-style call with cap warrants, on the U.S dollar/mark, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.44 DEM		  CAP	    1.49 DEM</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.14 DEM		  LISTING	FRFT,DUSS</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	22.OCT.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  US$/DEM - 1.5421 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
